WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
A cobalt route lies across a hall drawn in light lines.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.400
The hall's structure fills in around the route.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.920
Daylight reveals the hall. A cleaning robot and nearby people are still. Concept visual, not live deployment footage.
